        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>Fast, reckless, and effective, an <strong>enforcer</strong> never runs from a fight. They protect the weaker members of their crew, using their Bull Rush feature to move quickly through the field. If they’re stuck at a distance, an enforcer in Era 2 can use their Shotgun, but every enforcer’s priority is getting into melee to use their Unarmed Strike to restrain a foe.</p><p>Once their enemy is restrained, an enforcer uses their Breaking Bones action to devastate a single target, or they leverage their Improvising ability to wreck multiple enemies at once. An enforcer struggling to restrain a target can use Knockdown to set up their next Unarmed Strike.</p>",
        "role": "rival"
    },
